---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import fotoPerfil from "@/assets/foto_perfil.png";
---

<section id="sobre" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden">

  <!-- Blob de fundo -->
  <div
    class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 h-[500px] w-[500px] rounded-full bg-primary/8 blur-[100px] -z-10"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div data-reveal class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-border bg-muted px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4">
        Sobre
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">
        Jean Reis, Engenheiro de IA Generativa
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Visual -->
      <div data-reveal class="flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative">
          <!-- Anel decorativo externo -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 -m-8 rounded-full border border-dashed border-primary/20 animate-spin" style="animation-duration:25s"></div>
          <!-- Anel intermediário -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 -m-4 rounded-full border border-primary/10"></div>

          <!-- Imagem -->
          <div class="relative w-72 h-72 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-border shadow-2xl bg-card">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/15 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
            <Image
              src={fotoPerfil}
              alt="Jean Reis, engenheiro de IA generativa"
              width={288}
              height={288}
              loading="lazy"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Card com nome -->
          <div
            data-reveal
            data-reveal-delay="0.2"
            class="absolute -bottom-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-max rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-2.5 shadow-lg text-center"
          >
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Jean Reis</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground italic">"Daria tudo que sei pela metade do que ignoro."</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Badge flutuante: país -->
          <div
            data-reveal
            data-reveal-delay="0.3"
            class="absolute -top-3 -right-6 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-3 py-2 shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-primary shrink-0">
              <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M13.618 21.367A2.37 2.37 0 0 1 12 22a2.37 2.37 0 0 1-1.617-.633C6.412 17.626 1.09 13.447 3.685 7.38C5.09 4.1 8.458 2 12.001 2s6.912 2.1 8.315 5.38c2.592 6.06-2.717 10.259-6.698 13.987Z"/><path d="M15.5 11a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-7 0a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 7 0Z"/></g>
            </svg>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium">Brasil</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Conteúdo -->
      <div class="space-y-6">

        <div data-reveal class="space-y-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Sou engenheiro de IA generativa com mais de 10 anos em TI,
            focado na construção de agentes, pipelines RAG e automações inteligentes que resolvem problemas reais de negócio.
            Atuo sob uma premissa simples: <strong class="text-foreground">
              a IA deve funcionar no mundo real</strong>, não só em demos.
          </p>
          <p>
            Utilizo as principais ferramentas e modelos do ecossistema de IA para entregar soluções que geram resultado mensurável.
            Por atuar de forma independente e sem intermediários, garanto atenção total a cada projeto do início ao fim —
            você fala direto com quem vai construir a solução.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Destaques -->
        <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1" class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-primary/20 bg-card p-4 space-y-2">
            <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 2a4 4 0 0 1 4 4c0 1.5-.83 2.82-2.04 3.53L15 12H9l1.04-2.47A4 4 0 0 1 8 6a4 4 0 0 1 4-4z"/><path d="M9 12v2a3 3 0 0 0 6 0v-2"/><path d="M12 17v4"/></g>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Engenheiro de IA</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">LLMs · Agentes · MCP</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-indigo-500/20 bg-card p-4 space-y-2">
            <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-500 dark:text-indigo-400">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4.03 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"/><path d="M3 12c0 1.66 4.03 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3"/></g>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold">RAG & Retrieval</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Embeddings · Vector DB</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-yellow-500/20 bg-card p-4 space-y-2">
            <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-yellow-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-yellow-500 dark:text-yellow-400">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></g>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Automação</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">MCP · Integrações · API</p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
